{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":29,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷被圍"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「亞利伊勒","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"，亞利伊勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大衛安營的城啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘管你年復一年地守節期，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我終必叫你受苦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必悲傷哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我面前成為一座祭壇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必安營把你團團圍住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"屯兵圍困你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修築高臺攻打你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必一敗塗地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躺在塵土中說話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你細微的聲音從土中傳來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像地下幽靈的聲音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必從塵埃中喃喃細語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你的眾仇敵必像纖細的塵埃一樣消散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾多的殘暴之徒必如被風颳去的糠秕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"突然，刹那之間，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華必帶著雷轟、地震、巨響、旋風、暴風和烈火來臨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打、圍困亞利伊勒及其堡壘的各國軍隊必如夢幻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如夜間的異象一樣消失。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們好像饑餓的人夢中吃飯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醒來仍然饑餓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像口渴的人夢中喝水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醒來仍然渴得發昏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打錫安山的各國軍隊都必如此。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們駐足驚奇吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們自我蒙蔽，繼續瞎眼吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們醉了，但不是因為酒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們東倒西歪，但不是因為烈酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華把沉睡的靈傾倒在你們身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂封住你們的眼睛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蓋住你們的頭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的眼睛就是先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的頭就是先見。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["對你們而言，這整個啟示都好像封了印的書卷。你們把書卷交給識字的人讀，他會說：「我不能讀，這書卷是封著的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你們把書卷交給不識字的人讀，他會說：「我不識字。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"主說：「這些人嘴上親近我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們用嘴唇尊崇我，心卻遠離我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們敬拜我不過是遵行人定的規條。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要再次行奇妙無比的事，使他們震驚。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們智者的智慧必泯滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明哲的聰明必消失。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些向耶和華深藏計謀的人有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們暗中行事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以為誰也無從看見和知曉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們顛倒是非！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"窯匠豈可被看作泥土？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受造者豈可對創造者說","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你沒有造我」？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陶器怎能對陶匠說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你什麼也不懂」？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"再過不久，黎巴嫩將變成沃野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沃野上莊稼將茂密如林。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，耳聾的必聽見那書卷上的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盲人的眼睛必能看穿黑暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卑微的人必因耶和華而歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"貧窮的人必因以色列的聖者而快樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殘暴之徒必消失，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嘲諷者必絕跡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有伺機作惡者必被剷除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們惡言誣陷人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暗算城門口的審判官，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用謊言冤枉無辜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，關於雅各家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救贖亞伯拉罕的耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「雅各的子孫必不再羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臉上再無懼色。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們看見我賜給他們的子孫時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必尊我的名為聖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必尊雅各的聖者為聖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必敬畏以色列的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心裡迷惘的必明白真理，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發怨言的必欣然受教。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"「亞利伊勒」在此處用來指錫安/耶路撒冷，2節、7節同。","reference":{"chapter":29,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/29.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/30.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/28.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}